# TM.1: horizontal and word motions (h l Left Right BSpace 0 Home $ End ^
# w b e W B E), each followed by the cursor readout, over
# tests/fixtures/copy/fixture.txt: indentation, separators, wide gaps,
# wide characters, trailing blanks, a line wrapped twice, punctuation.
